      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Chris Alexiuk has a simple rule about open source AI: If you believe in it, be loud about it.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-life-chris-alexiuk/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T16:00:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:54.684Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "“We should be shouting about this technology from the rooftops,” said Alexiuk, a Toronto-based senior product research engineer in deep learning at NVIDIA who specializes in making open large language models (LLMs) practical for working developers.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-life-chris-alexiuk/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T16:00:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:54.684Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Having spent years teaching developers to build with open models, Alexiuk has concluded that transparency isn’t a feature of good AI; it’s the precondition for it.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-life-chris-alexiuk/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T16:00:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:54.684Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "“Fully open source AI is necessary for the democratization of intelligence,” he said.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-life-chris-alexiuk/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T16:00:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:54.684Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "1 Nemotron Fan,” referring to the NVIDIA Nemotron family of open source, multimodal models built for long-running, self-evolving and specialized AI agents.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-life-chris-alexiuk/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T16:00:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:54.684Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "1 fan of whoever is doing that the best.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-life-chris-alexiuk/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T16:00:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:54.684Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "It’s this matter-of-fact directness and affable approachability that makes Alexiuk’s teaching style so appealing.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-life-chris-alexiuk/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T16:00:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:54.684Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "It’s no surprise, then, that Alexiuk likens Nemotron to a magical library — its users fellow wizards in search of knowledge that can move mountains.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-life-chris-alexiuk/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-05T16:00:05.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-07T16:22:54.684Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "“There’s a category of model that’s going to be close to the kind of work you want to accomplish,” Alexiuk said, explaining that Nemotron supports that whole ecosystem of AI users: from individual developers using a model like Nemotron 3.5 Lightning for repetitive, high-freque…",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.nvidia.com/blog/nvidia-life-chris-alexiuk/",
